{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkov","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.MarkovMoves"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.holTrace_eq_of_markovEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.holTrace_eq_of_markovEquiv","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L184-L197","doc":"**Markov-equivalent words have equal framing-corrected multiplicative-integral traces**,\nincluding words on different numbers of strands. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass_wordBraid_eq_tlStateSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass_wordBraid_eq_tlStateSum","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L169-L182","doc":"**The mass identity on braid classes, Temperley–Lieb state-sum form (Option 3).**\nThe framing-corrected mass functional of the braid class of `wordBraid ℓs` expands over all\nTemperley–Lieb states `s : Fin ℓs.length → Bool`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass_wordBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass_wordBraid","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L156-L167","doc":"**The mass identity on braid classes.** The mass functional of the class of a word on `m+1`\nstrands is the site-weighted trace of the word's discrete multiplicative integral, times the\nstrand and writhe framing factors:\n`m([β_ℓ]) = A^{m+1} · B^{writhe ℓ} · wi^{m+1} · Tr(K^{⊗(m+1)} · Hol(ℓ))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.exists_word_of_braidClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.exists_word_of_braidClass","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L144-L152","doc":"Every braid class is the class of a word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.exists_wordBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.exists_wordBraid","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L127-L142","doc":"**Every braid is spelled by a word.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.wordBraid_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.wordBraid_inv","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L115-L125","doc":"The inverse word: reversed, with every crossing sign flipped. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.wordBraid_append","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.wordBraid_append","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L111-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.letterBraid_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.letterBraid_flip","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L107-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.flipLetter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.flipLetter","kind":"def","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L104-L105","doc":"The letter with the opposite crossing sign. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass_classOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass_classOf","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L96-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.massClass","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L91-L94","doc":"**The mass functional on braid classes.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.jonesTot_isMarkovInvariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.jonesTot_isMarkovInvariant","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L79-L89","doc":"**Both Markov moves leave the framing-corrected trace unchanged** at the weight the peel\nforces, `w = (1, q²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.jonesTot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.jonesTot","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L74-L77","doc":"The framing-corrected trace `jonesFn` as a functional on the whole tower. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.BraidClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.BraidClass","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L67-L68","doc":"Braid classes: braids on any number of strands modulo the two Markov moves. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.artinTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassTraceMarkovClass.artinTower","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/MassTraceMarkovClass.lean#L60-L65","doc":"**The tower of Artin braid groups.** Level `n` is the braid group on `n+1` strands; the\nstabilisation homomorphism adds an inert strand on the right, and the new generator is the\ncrossing of the last two strands. ","signatureChunk":0}]}